672: /// The observation the thread/sub-agent/account aggregation keeps after seeing `b`: PER WINDOW,
673: /// a candidate window is compared with the instant of THAT retained window - strictly newer
674: /// replaces, an equal instant takes the total [`cmp_window_rank`] at `now`, older is kept; a window
675: /// the candidate lacks (or an invalid one) never replaces. Each kept window carries its own
676: /// instant; `at` of the result is derived (the latest of them), for display only.
677: pub fn merge_observation(
678:     a: Option<Observation>,
679:     b: Option<&Observation>,
680:     now: DateTime<Utc>,
